---------------------------------------------------------------------------

This library's protocol implementation is a TypeScript port derived from two
MIT-licensed reverse-engineering projects. Neither is a runtime dependency;
their work is gratefully acknowledged.

1) niimbot-web-bluetooth — https://github.com/iscarelli/niimbot-web-bluetooth
   Copyright (c) iscarelli — MIT License.
   Source of the hardware-validated V4 / B1 print-task sequences, the
   total-mode row encoding, the run-length scheme, and the BLE flow-control
   findings.

2) niimbluelib — https://github.com/MultiMote/niimbluelib
   Copyright (c) MultiMote — MIT License.
   Source of the printer model registry (model ids, dpi, printhead widths,
   print directions, density ranges) and the packet abstractions.

Both projects are distributed under the MIT License, the full text of which
appears above and applies equally to the portions derived from them.
